 "Owner row 15 contradicts itself: it lists `leaning · won_over` among vocabularies 'persisted nowhere' while §5.4 and the landed MeetingLeanChannel typedef persist it as `band` on every meetingLeanChannels row; three, not four, are unpersisted (CONFIRMED).",
